  "notes": "Issued in a matte-finish picture card sleeve, plain paper inner Made in Great Britain, Patent Nos. 1,125,555.\nAll songs published by Virgin Music (Publishers) Ltd., except A5 Virgin Music (Publishers) Ltd./Island Music Ltd. and B4b Rondor Music (London) Ltd..\nTracks B4a and B4b are listed as one on the sleeve and on the labels with time given 3:24.\nThis copy states that the country of manufacture is as stated on the Record Label, this is not so although it is probably a UK copy.\nVariant 8 has a sticker \"Special Price\" at the top right of the sleeve and \"The Police\" in red. Inner sleeve has \"Special Price High Quality Pressing\" stamped.\n(P) 1978 A&M Records Ltd.\nPublishers: \nA1-A4, B1-B3,B4a,B5: Virgin Music Publishers Limited.\nA5: Virgin Music Publishers Limited/ Island Music Limited\nB4b: Rondor Music (London) Ltd.\n\nMatrices are etched except for the 'CBS' letter & number stamps away from the main matrix string: \"A, B, C, D, E, 1, 2, 3, 4, 8, 11\"",
  "released_formatted": "1978",
